    "body": "_From https://github.com/MozillaFoundation/mofo-devops-private/issues/103 :_\r\n\r\nWe're asking contributors to provide data about projects that could include PII. Our reviewers and (staff that submit content) should be aware of what data we can and can't make publicly available.\r\n\r\n* Can we add some kind of section to the Admin area to remind people what is appropriate and what's not. (i.e. \"don't approve the publishing of PII\")\r\n* Can we add information to the submission forms about what data is or is not appropriate?\r\n\r\nI'm hoping we can identify if any changes need to be made to help us moderate the content we post. \r\n",
